ion/problem "Consider the following relation defined on the set $A={5,8,10}.$ \n\n$$\nR={(5,5),(5,8),(8,10),(10,5),(10,8)}\n$$\n\nSelect the options that make the following reasoning correct:" :question/worked-solution "A binary relation $R,$ defined on a set $A,$ is \n\n- *reflexive* if $(x,x)\\in R$ for all $x\\in A,$\n\n- *irreflexive* if $(x,x)\\notin R$ for all $x\\in A.$\n\nIf some pairs of the form $(x,x)$ belong to a relation and others do not, then the relation is neither reflexive nor irreflexive.\n\nIn our case, the relation is defined on ${5,8,10},$ and we have\n\n$$\n(5,5)\\in R,\\,(8,8)\\notin R,\\,(10,10)\\notin R.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we can conclude the following:\n\n$\\,$ Since $(8,8)\\notin R$ $\\text{and }(5,5)\\in R,$ the relation is $\\text{neither reflexive nor irreflexive}.$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-fda8b711-985c-5852-bdd4-bf39e26cbcb3" "answer-field-53ddf693-74ca-5e2d-9e1e-11945c9d1c36" "answer-field-20d4334e-5dd0-5d0b-8425-ff01d69ca356"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-fda8b711-985c-5852-bdd4-bf39e26cbcb3" :answer-field/id #uuid "fda8b711-985c-5852-bdd4-bf39e26cbcb3" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/select :answer-field/correct "answer-677d9cb3-c73e-5ff2-a9e6-7559fff95920" :answer-field/choices ["answer-9b54f1e3-d1a2-5080-84e1-5127f79e85d9" "answer-677d9cb3-c73e-5ff2-a9e6-7559fff95920" "answer-5be33121-9c2b-573c-9934-610fc79750c6" "answer-15ff79dc-703d-570b-a9aa-b16ef1672f52"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-9b54f1e3-d1a2-5080-84e1-5127f79e85d9" :answer/id #uuid "9b54f1e3-d1a2-5080-84e1-5127f79e85d9" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(5,10)\\notin R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-677d9cb3-c73e-5ff2-a9e6-7559fff95920" :answer/id #uuid "677d9cb3-c73e-5ff2-a9e6-7559fff95920" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "(8,8)\\notin R" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer